### Taxable Transactions API Documentation
### Get taxable transactions (المعاملات الخاضعة للضريبة) for authenticated user

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@contentType = application/json
@token = your-jwt-token-here

### ============================================
### GET TAXABLE TRANSACTIONS
### ============================================
### Get paginated list of taxable transactions for the authenticated user
### Returns only transactions with taxStatus = "TAXABLE" and status = "COMPLETED"
### Requires user JWT token

GET {{baseUrl}}/wallet/transactions/taxable?page=1&limit=20
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Query Parameters:
### - page: Page number (optional, default: 1)
### - limit: Items per page (optional, default: 20, max: 100)

### Response Example (200 OK):
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Taxable transactions fetched successfully",
###   "data": {
###     "items": [
###       {
###         "id": "transaction-uuid",
###         "userId": "user-uuid",
###         "amount": 900.00,
###         "currency": "SAR",
###         "type": "ESCROW_RELEASE",
###         "status": "COMPLETED",
###         "taxStatus": "TAXABLE",
###         "fromWalletId": "escrow-wallet-uuid",
###         "toWalletId": "freelancer-wallet-uuid",
###         "contractId": "contract-uuid",
###         "description": "Freelancer payment from escrow release",
###         "createdAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
###         "updatedAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"
###       }
###     ],
###     "pagination": {
###       "page": 1,
###       "limit": 20,
###       "total": 5,
###       "pages": 1
###     }
###   }
### }

### ============================================
### USAGE EXAMPLES
### ============================================

### Example 1: Get first page of taxable transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallet/transactions/taxable
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Example 2: Get second page with 10 items per page
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallet/transactions/taxable?page=2&limit=10
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Example 3: Get all taxable transactions (max 100 per page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallet/transactions/taxable?page=1&limit=100
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### NOTES
### ============================================
### - Only returns transactions where taxStatus = "TAXABLE"
### - Only returns transactions where status = "COMPLETED"
### - Users can only see their own taxable transactions
### - Typically these are ESCROW_RELEASE transactions where money was paid to freelancer
### - Useful for tax reporting and generating tax documents
### - Transactions are ordered by createdAt DESC (newest first)
